### Categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories

### Create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Не работает принтер","description":"Кабинет 12","categoryId":2,"priority":"HIGH","dueAt":"2027-01-01T12:00:00Z"}

### Read
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/1

### Filter
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?priority=HIGH&page=0&size=10

### Edit
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Проверить драйвер","priority":"MEDIUM","dueAt":null}

### Change status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"IN_PROGRESS"}

### History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/1/history

### Kotlin report
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/summary?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2028-01-01T00:00:00Z
